<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id">Zefania</book>
  <para style="h">Zefania</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zefania</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zefania</para>
  <para style="mt">Zefania</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai ramah Amona fapa Josia a lal laiin, Zefania hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a. Ani chu Hezekia thlah, Amaria fapa Gedalia fapa, Kusa fapa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Lei chunga thil awm zawng zawng ka tiboral vek dâwn,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mihring leh ramsa ka tiboral vek ang a, Chunglêng sava leh tuifinriat sanghate pawh; Mi sualte ka inchhuihthlûktîr ang a, Lei ata mihring ka nuai bo vang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Juda-ho chungah kut ka thlâk ang a, Jerusalem-a chêng zawng zawng chungah pawh; Baal hnuhma zawng zawng he hmun ata hi Ka paih chhuak vek ang a, Milem puithiamte hming pawh Tu man an hre reng tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni te, thla te, arsi te in chung zâwla biaa, Lalpa chibai bûka, a hnêna thu tiam sia, Milkoma hnêna chhia chham leh site leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa hawisana zui duh lote, Lalpa zawng lova amah râwn duh lote, Ka tiboral ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa P athian hmaah chuan ngawi ṭhiap rawh u, Lalpa ni chu a hnai ta si a. Lalpa chuan inthawina a buatsaih zo va, A mi sâwmte pawh a tithianghlim ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“ Lalpa inthawina ni-ah chuan Hotu te, lal fa te, hnam dang tih dân latute ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan milem biate tih dân anga Kawngka bul zuan khûmtu te, Mi thil an chhuhsak leh rûka An pathian in tikhattute chu ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Jerusalem-a Sangha Kawngkaah An ṭap chuah chuah ang a, Vêngtharah pawh mangangin an au vang a, Mualahte chuan an chiau vawng vawng ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Dâwr hmuna awmte u, ṭap vak rawh u, Sumdâwngtute an awm tawh dâwn si lo, Tangkaruaa sumdâwngtute pawh an awm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Jerusalem chu khâwnvâr chhiin, Zu ṭawk tawh anga awm mai mai, Inchhuang taka titute chu ka vai khâwm ang a, ka hrem ang. ‘ Lalpa chuan thil chhia emaw, thil ṭha emaw a ti lo vang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An sum an rawksak vek ang a, An inte pawh a ram ang, Inte sa mah sela an luah lo vang, Grepte phun mah sela, a tui an in lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa ni ropui a lo thleng dâwn ta, A hnai hle tawh a, a lo thleng ṭêp a ni. Lalpa nia thâwm chu a râpthlâk êm a, Mi huaisente pawh an ṭê tuar tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chumi ni chu thinurna ni, lungngaihna leh manganna ni, Buai ni leh chhiat ni, thimna leh nguina ni, Khaw dur leh thim chhah mup thlen ni a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khawpui kulh leh in sângte bei tûra tawtawrâwt ri tuar tuar leh indo au thâwm awm ni a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mite chu nasa takin ka timangang ang a, Mitdel angin an kal ang; Lalpa laka an sual avângin An thisen chu vaivut leihbuak angin a baw nuai ang a, An ruang pawh bawlhhlawh awm khâwm nûlh ang a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa thinur lo thlen ni-ah chuan, An tangkarua leh rangkachakte chuan a chhanhim thei lo vang a, A thinurna mei chuan lei pum pui a kâng ral vek ang. Lei chunga awm zawng zawng tân, Tâwp thutna a thleng ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zah nachâng hre lo hnamte u, In-au khâwm ula, pung khâwm rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Buhsi anga len bo in nih tûr hun ruat thlen hma, Lalpa thinur na tak in chunga a lo thlen hma leh Lalpa thinrimnain a nan hma che u hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram chhûnga mi tlâwm, a thupêk zâwmtute chuan Lalpa chu zawng rawh u, Dik takin ti ula, thuhnuairawlh takin awm rawh u, Lalpa thinur ni-ah chuan in him mial mahna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gaza khua an rauhsan ang a, Askelon pawh a chhe vek ang. Asdod mite chu chhûn laiah an ûm chhuak ang a, Ekron khaw mite pawh an kawi chhuak vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipui kama chêng, Keriot mite u, In chung a pik e! Lalpan in chungthu a sawi hi: Filistia mite chênna Kanan ram chu, luahtu awm lo khawpin ka tichhe vek ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuipui kamte chu a hnim vek ang a, Berâm huang leh berâmpute bûk khuarna hmun a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda hnam thi bângten chûng ram chu an nei ang a, An berâmte chu an tlattîr ang. Zânah Askelon mite in ruakah an riak ang a, Lalpa an P athian -in a duhsak ang a, A tihmuingîl leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab mite chapozia te, Amon mite an chhiatziate ka hria a, An ram chhuhsak tuma chapo taka ka mite an vau dânte pawh ka hre reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Moab chu Sodom angin a chhia ang a, Amon mite pawh Gomora mite ang an ni ang. An ram chu chi leilung, kângṭhaia khat, Eng atân maha tlâktlai tawh lo a ni ang. Ka mi, thi bângten an rûn ang a, Ka hnam zînga la dam chhunten an neihsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An chapo man an hmu dâwn, Engkim Lalpa mite an hmuhsita an nuihzatbûr avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chu an tân ṭihbaiawm tak a ni ang. A ni, lei chunga pathian zawng zawng chu a hrêk chau vang a, Tuipui kama chêng hnam tinrêng ten Amah chu mahni hmun ṭheuhvah chibai an bûk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangni, Ethiopia mite pawh Ka khandaiha thah in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hmâr lam ram chungah a kut a lek ang a, Asuria chu a tichhia ang; Ninevi khua pawh a tiṭiau vek ang a, Thlalêr ramrovah a chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutah chuan ranrual leh sa tinrêng, A rualin an bawk ang a, Thlalêr chhimbuk leh hrângkirte chu, Ban chhîp bâwkah an riak ang a, Tukverhahte an hrâm ang a, Kailâwnahte choak an fu ang a, Sidar thing inte pawh a chhe rem rum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hei hi khawpui chapo, pawisak nei lo, ‘Kei aia chak tu nge awm?’ ti rilru ṭhîntu awm dân chu a ni. Mahse, heti khawp hian a chhe ta si a, Ramsate riahhmun mai a lo ni ta, A hmu apiangin diriam takin an chek khum tlawk tlawk ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hel hmang leh bawlhhlawh, Hnehchhiah chîng khawpui chu, A chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zilhna a pawm lo va, a ngaithla duh lo, Lalpa a ring lo va, a Pathian chu a hnaih duh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khaw hotute chu sakeibaknei rûm ang an ni a, Rorêltute pawh chinghne koham ang an ni, A tûk atân eng mah an khêk thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zâwlneite chu an ngaih a sam a, bum an chîng a, Puithiamte pawhin thil thianghlim an tibawlhhlawh a, An duh duhin Dân chu an bâwlzân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chhûnga awm Lalpa chu a dik a, thil sual a ti ngai lo, Tûk tin khêl lovin dik takin ro a rêl ṭhîn. Mi sualte erawh chuan zah nachâng rêng an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hnamte chu ka nuai bo va, an kulh bang ka tichhia a, An kawtthlêrte ka tiram a, tu man an tlawh tawh lo vang. An khawpuite chu a chhe ta a, A ruak vek a, tu mah an chêng tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Anni chuan min ṭih ang a, zilhna an pawm ang a, Khaw chhûnga chêngte chu ka tiboral lo vang, An chunga tih ka tum pawh ka ṭhulh ang,’ Ka lo ti a; mahse, suahsual bâwl zui zêl an duh ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, hnamte ka chachhuah ni chu lo nghâk rawh u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Ka tum chu hei hi a ni: Hnam te, lal ram te ka ko khâwm ang a, An chungah ka thinur, ka thinurna mei sa tak chu ka leih ang, Ka thîkna mei chuan khawvêl pum hi a kâng ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan mite hmui chu ka tidanglam ang a, An vaiin Lalpa hming chauh an lam ang a, Rilru hmun khatin a rawng an bâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi be ṭhîntu, Ethiopia lui râla darhhote chuan, Ka tân thilhlan an rawn keng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan ka chunga in bawhchhiatna thiltihte chu In zahpui tawh lo vang a, In zîng ata mi chapo, induh tak takte chu ka la bo dâwn si a, Ka tlâng thianghlimah chuan chapo takin in awm ngai tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In zînga mi tlâwmte leh mi hnuaihnungte chu ka hum ang a, Lalpa hming chu an tân himna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel zînga la damte chuan thil sual an ti lo vang a, Dâwt an sawi lo vang a, Bum an chîng tawh hek lo vang. An eiin an in ang a, thlamuang takin an awm tawh ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw, Zion fanu, hlim takin zai la, Aw Israel, ring takin au rawh. Jerusalem fanute u, in thinlung zawng zawngin lâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hremna tûr che u a la bo ta, I hmêlmate a hruai bo ta, Lalpa , Israel lal chu, in zîngah a awm a, Thil ṭha lo i hlau tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Jerusalem hnênah, ‘Aw Zion, hlau suh, I kutte chu zawi suh se,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />LALPA, i Pathian, hnehtu huaisen chu i hnênah a awm a, I chungah a lâwm êm êm a, A hmangaihna chuan i nun a tithar ang, Zîng taka zaiin i chungah a lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I mi, kût hmang pha ve lova mangangte chu ka hruai khâwm ang a, Tichuan, sawichhiat an ni tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Chumi hunah chuan nangmah tiduhdahtu zawng zawng chu, An chungchâng ka ngaihtuah ang a, Kebaite pawh ka chhan chhuak ang a, Hnawh darhte ka khâwm ang a, Ram tina mualpho taka awm ṭhînte kha, Hming mawi an nei ang a, mi tinin an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan ka hruai khâwm ang che u a, Ka hruai haw ang che u. Leia mi zawng zawngin an hmu ang che u a, An chawimawi ang che u. Ka chawimawi ang che u. Ka tihhmuingîl leh ni che u chu In mit ngeiin in hmu ang,” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
</usx>
